    "Successful locations are saved by IP on this Mac. Offline country data is used when no saved location is available; online services only refresh optional details." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功查询的位置按 IP 保存在本机。没有已有记录时使用离线国家库，在线服务只负责补充和更新详情。"}}}},
