    "Overview" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"概览"}}}},
    "Periodic metadata verification" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"定期重新校验资料"}}}},
    "Performs a best-effort proxy or VPN classification only for a newly seen public address." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅对新出现的公网地址进行尽力而为的代理或 VPN 判断。"}}}},
    "Preview" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览"}}}},
    "Primary public IP" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"主要公网 IP"}}}},
    "Prism uses a mainland-accessible IPIP endpoint for the domestic IPv4 observation and as a fallback when overseas address services are unavailable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 使用中国大陆可访问的 IPIP 端点独立观察国内 IPv4，并在海外地址服务不可用时作为回退。"}}}},
    "Prism checks IPv4 and IPv6 independently. Location lookup prefers IPv4 and uses IPv6 when IPv4 is unavailable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 会分别检测 IPv4 和 IPv6。位置查询优先使用 IPv4；IPv4 不可用时使用 IPv6。"}}}},
    "Prism checks every 5 seconds while stable, briefly switches to 250 ms confirmation after a possible change, and reduces activity in Low Power Mode." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"网络稳定时每 5 秒检查一次；发现可能变化后短暂切换至 250 毫秒确认，低电量模式下会自动降低频率。"}}}},
    "Prism checks the public exit four times per second. Location services are contacted only after the address changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 持续监测公网出口；只有地址变化后才会请求位置服务。"}}}},
    "Prism could not determine the current network exit." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 无法确定当前网络出口。"}}}},
    "Prism has no account, analytics, advertising, telemetry, or browsing-history collection." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prism 不包含账号、分析、广告、遥测，也不收集浏览记录。"}}}},
    "Prism records a new item when the public IP, country, or ASN changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"公网 IP、国家/地区或 ASN 变化时，Prism 才会新增记录。"}}}},
